<title>USA: Styling Technology aims for $30.8 million IPO.</title>
<headline>Styling Technology aims for $30.8 million IPO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Styling Technology Corp raised the number of shares it plans to offer in its planned initial public offering to 2.8 million from a prior estimate of 2.2 million, according to a regulatory filing.</p>
<p>The shares, which are to trade on the Nasdaq under the symbol &quot;STYL&quot;, are expected to price in a range of $10 to $12. Based on the midpoint of the pricing range, the deal is worth roughly $30.8 million.</p>
<p>The perfumes and cosmetics firm is based in Phoenix, Arizona.</p>
</text>
